ZaydPanel (Standalone Control Panel)
│
├── 📦 zaydpanel-installer.sh          ← 1 command install di VPS mana saja
│
├── 🖥️ zaydpanel-core (Next.js App)     ← Panel UI + API
│   ├── Admin Panel
│   │   ├── Server overview (CPU, RAM, Disk)
│   │   ├── Manage websites (CRUD)
│   │   ├── Manage users (multi-user + ACL)
│   │   ├── Packages (Starter/Business/Premium)
│   │   └── Server settings (PHP, Nginx, MariaDB)
│   │
│   └── Customer Panel (pelanggan login sendiri)
│       ├── Dashboard (overview situs)
│       ├── Manage Website (domain, PHP version, SSL)
│       ├── Install WordPress / Joomla / Laravel (1 klik)
│       ├── File Manager
│       ├── Database Manager (MySQL)
│       ├── Email Manager
│       ├── FTP Manager
│       ├── Backup & Restore
│       └── Statistik (bandwidth, disk usage)
│
├── ⚙️ zaydpanel-agent (Python daemon)   ← Jalan di background, eksekusi perintah
│   ├── Create/Delete website (Nginx vhost + PHP-FPM pool + home dir)
│   ├── Create/Delete MySQL database + user
│   ├── Install WordPress via WP-CLI
│   ├── SSL Let's Encrypt via acme.sh
│   ├── File operations (list, upload, delete, rename)
│   ├── Email account management
│   ├── FTP account management
│   └── Backup/Restore (tar.gz)
│
└── 🔌 Hooks (opsional, connect ke billing)
    └── Webhook API → integrasi ZaydCluster billing
